<title>JAPAN: Bank of Japan refrains from money market operation.</title>
<headline>Bank of Japan refrains from money market operation.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) refrained from conducting a regular money market operation on Friday, money traders said.  </p>
<p>The market is in net surplus of an estimated 190 billion yen for the day.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-33432-8570</p>
